---
description: >-
  The markdownAlwaysOn twin of label-syntax.mmd: the same gantt labels
  with the setting on, so every label is markdown. The plain
  **bold** _ital_ rows of the title, section names, tasks, milestones
  and vert markers draw bold and italic, bare backticks and the code
  span draw inline code; tags, \n and quoted markdown strings draw as in
  the default picture, which this one differs from.
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
---
gantt
  title title **bold** _ital_ and <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %m-%d
  section section **bold** _ital_
    task **bold** _ital_ :a1, 2024-01-01, 12d
    milestone **bold** _ital_ :milestone, m1, after a1, 0d
  section "`section **bold** _ital_`"
    "`task **bold** _ital_`" :a2, after a1, 12d
    "`milestone **bold** _ital_`" :milestone, m2, after a2, 0d
  section `section **bold** _ital_`
    `task **bold** _ital_` :a3, after a2, 12d
    `milestone **bold** _ital_` :milestone, m3, after a3, 0d
  section section a `code` b
    task a `code` b :a4, after a3, 12d
    milestone a `code` b :milestone, m4, after a4, 0d
  section section <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O
    task <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O :a5, after a4, 12d
    milestone <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O :milestone, m5, after a5, 0d
  section section one\ntwo
    task one\ntwo :a6, after a5, 12d
    milestone one\ntwo :milestone, m6, after a6, 0d
    "`vert **bold** _ital_`" :vert, v1, 2024-01-25, 0d
    vert **bold** _ital_ <b>tag</b><br>next :vert, v2, 2024-02-20, 0d
